# Manang Ana - Unified Everyday Purchase Timeline (3-Slot Sandwich Pattern)
# Shifts ONLY on meaningful story flags (Flag_AnaFlewAgain / Flag_AnaUtangAccepted).
# Includes 3-Choice Repayment (Accept / Forgive / Defer) and Smooth First-Utang Story Bridge.
# Voice: Quietly warm, observant, genuine Nanay voice. Zero superficial exclamation crutches.

label Greeting
# Slot 1: P1-P3 Reactive Opener or High-Price Remark
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	ManangAna: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
elif {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	ManangAna: Prices crept up again, anak? Even garlic at the market is getting hard to budget.

# Slot 2: Upfront Utang Ask (with First-Utang Story Bridge) OR Flag-Driven Request Pool
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	if {Flag_AnaUtangAccepted} == false and {Flag_AnaUtangRefused} == false:
		ManangAna: Wait, anak, let me recount my palm. No, I really came up short, and my eatery pay hasn't cleared yet.
		ManangAna: Promised myself I'd look after you once your Lola passed, not stand here asking a kid for credit.
		ManangAna: My rice pot's already warm at home, though. Could you write [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] in your lista just until payday?
		- Put your coins away. Sure.
			[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
			[signal arg="flag:ana_utang_accepted_early=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:+1"]
			[signal arg="note:Put her groceries on the lista without hesitation when she first came up short."]
			ManangAna: Anak. You don't know how heavy my feet felt walking up here to ask.
			ManangAna: Write every peso down clearly, ha. Grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever your hands are free.
		- Until payday, Manang. Deal.
			[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
			[signal arg="flag:ana_utang_accepted_early=true"]
			[signal arg="note:Allowed her first utang with an agreement to settle once her eatery pay comes in."]
			ManangAna: Thank you for not making a fuss over it, anak. Soon as my pay lands, I'm coming straight here.
			ManangAna: Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] before that rice dries out.
		- Sorry, cash only right now.
			[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
			[signal arg="flag:ana_utang_refused_early=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:-1"]
			[signal arg="note:Turned down her first utang request when cash was tight."]
			ManangAna: No, no, wipe that guilty look off your face, anak. Keeping a young shop alive is hard enough.
			ManangAna: I'll stretch ginger and salt with our leftover rice at home and come back once my pay clears.
	else:
		ManangAna: Hate adding another line to my page, anak, my purse came up a few coins short for the stove again.
		ManangAna: Could you put [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] on my lista? I'll fold every peso into my next payment.
		- Sure, adding it to your lista.
			[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
			ManangAna: Thank you, anak. Saves me from facing four hungry kids empty-handed.
		- Sorry, cash only this round.
			[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
			ManangAna: No hard feelings at all, anak. Let me check what's left in our pantry first.
elif {Flag_AnaFlewAgain}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		ManangAna: Shoulders feel ten years lighter lately, anak. Let me grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		ManangAna: Quick run, anak. My kids already started the rice at home. Could I get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		ManangAna: Have you eaten yet, anak? Don't work on an empty stomach. Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	else:
		ManangAna: Exact coins from the eatery tray, anak. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] for our table.
elif {Flag_AnaUtangAccepted}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		ManangAna: Quick breather between prep trays, anak. Could you grab me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		ManangAna: Cash in hand this pass, anak. Let me get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] before the rice cools off.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		ManangAna: Four teenagers empty a pantry faster than a storm, anak. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please.
	else:
		ManangAna: Resting my elbows here for one second, anak. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] when you're ready.
else:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		ManangAna: Line at the eatery stretched past the corner, anak. Let me grab [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		ManangAna: Stepping out before my broth boils over, anak. Could I get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		ManangAna: Keeping busy, anak? Make sure you drink water. Let me pick up [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	else:
		ManangAna: Long hours on my feet, anak. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please, whenever your hands are free.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
ManangAna: No rush, anak. Nice resting my knees for a moment anyway. Still waiting on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
- Coming right up, Manang.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, we're out of stock.
	ManangAna: Fresh out? That's alright, anak, I'll improvise with what's in the kitchen.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ManangAna: Thank you, anak. Still need [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever you're ready.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ManangAna: Straight into my market bag. Just waiting on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], no rush.
else:
	ManangAna: Got that part. Take your time with [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], anak.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	ManangAna: Thank you for putting that in the lista, anak. Take care behind that counter.
else:
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		ManangAna: Keep the extra coins, anak. Get yourself a proper snack.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 34:
		ManangAna: Thank you, anak. Don't forget to eat real rice meals, ha.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 67:
		ManangAna: Lifesaver, anak. Better get back before those four raid the stove.
	else:
		ManangAna: All set. Take care of yourself behind that counter, anak.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
ManangAna: Before I ask for anything, anak, here's the {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos from my line in your lista.
ManangAna: Set that aside straight from my eatery pay so we could square up properly.
- Thanks, crossing your name off.
	[signal arg="repay_debt"]
	ManangAna: Good. Nothing lets me breathe easier than a clean page in the ledger, anak.
- Keep it for the kids, Manang.
	[signal arg="forgive_debt"]
	[signal arg="tally:+1"]
	ManangAna: Wait, anak, you can't just wave that off, you earned every peso behind this counter.
	ManangAna: Stubborn kid, just like your Lola. Expect hot food at this counter soon, I won't take no for an answer.
- Pay me later, no rush.
	[signal arg="defer_repay"]
	ManangAna: Sure your register isn't stretched thin right now, anak?
	ManangAna: Thank you for the breathing room. I'll put this toward school fare and square up next pass.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
ManangAna: Wait, anak, check that label again. I asked for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
[end_timeline]
